  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the sleek and sophisticated atmosphere of The Zone, Warrensburg's premier tattoo studio, where the art of minimalism reigns supreme. With over 24 years of dedication to superior body modification and an APP Member Piercer on staff, we pride ourselves on crafting exquisite, understated designs in a state-of-the-art environment that prioritizes your comfort and safety.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Warrensburg, Missouri, United States\n\nThe Zone Tattoo and Body Piercing offers an APP Member Piercer & a Superior Body Modification Environment serving Central Missouri for over 28 years.",
